%%   (overview §12.18; no revision number, no decision ID, and no entity, attribute or relationship change).
%%   Recovery Sweep may set deliveries.state='expired' when events.expires_at has passed, even while
%%   dispatch_lease_token / dispatch_lease_expires_at are still set. That transition clears the worker
%%   lease pair, creates no delivery_attempts row, does not change attempt_count or dispatch_seq, and
